  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Concrete for common projects</h2>
    <p>Every row below includes the calculator's default 10% waste. "Truck order" rounds up to the next quarter yard, the increment most ready-mix suppliers use. Bag counts use typical yields: 0.60 cu ft per 80 lb bag and 0.45 cu ft per 60 lb bag.</p>
  </div>
